Package: n950-fm
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, alsa-utils, pulseaudio-utils
Recommends: python3
Description: FM radio for the Nokia N950
 The N950's FM receiver (the FM part of its WL1273, /dev/radio0 through
 radio-wl1273) for Hildon: frequency, seek, mute, signal, stereo, the RDS
 station name and radio text, saved stations. n950-fm-audio plays the
 receiver's analog output from the TWL5031's AUX inputs; n950-fm-test
 tries the receiver from a shell.
